                                "sense_id": "ff7ab80f-e228-3c75-bfe7-d107f7ce9817",
                                "text": "Nor has Dalua part or mention in the antique legend. Like other ancient things, this divinity hath come secretly upon us in a forgetful time, new and strange and terrible, though his unremembered shadow crossed our way when first we set out on our long travel, in the youth of the world."
                            }
                        ]
